    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "A most attractive two/three bedroom mid terrace house situated in the heart of cork city in this mature residential location. The property is in good condition thoughout and is ideally suited to a first time buyer or as an investment opportunity. The property is situated in close proximity to the emerging docklands and within walking distance of the city centre and all of its amenities include various shopping centres, the famous english market, local shops, entertainment venues and a wide variety of bars & restaurants."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "GROUND FLOOR\r\n\r\nHALLWAY\r\nCarpet, Panel Heater, Power Points.\r\n\r\nLIVING ROOM                                                                                                                                13.90 x 12.6\r\nCarpet, Panel Heater,  Curtains, Radiator, Power Points, TV Point.\r\n\r\nKITCHEN/DINING ROOM                                                                                                              10.8 x 9.50\r\nVinyl Floor, Floor Units, Plumbed for Washing Machine, Cooker Point Power Points.\r\n                                                                                                                                    \r\nSTAIRS & LANDING\r\nCarpet.\r\n\r\nFIRST FLOOR\r\n\r\nBEDROOM 1                                                                                                                                       11.00 x 7.10                   \r\nCarpet, Curtains, Panel Heater,  Clothes Closet, Curtains, Power Points.\r\n\r\nBEDROOM 2                                                                                                                                       10.20 x 9.30\r\nCarpet, Fitted, Curtains, Power Points.\r\n\r\n\r\nBATHROOM                                                                                                                                       7.40 x 5.90\r\nCeramic Floor, W.C., W.H.B., Electric Shower, Part Tiled.                                      \r\n\r\nSECOND FLOOR\r\n\r\nSTORAGE ROOM                                                                                                                            12.90 x 10.2"
